2. Interpret the argument: a GitHub URL → Branch A with Steps A1–A3 skipped; a `PLAN_NAME` (slug / numeric prefix / filename, matched against `metds/plans/*_plan.md`) → that plan drives the run; none → use the root plan (single-digit prefix `[0-9]_*_plan.md`; if several, ask which via `star_questionnaire`).
3. With no plan and no URL: when `${CODE_NAME}/` already holds real code, skip this question — Branch B organizes what exists and needs no plan, and this is the state `star-proj-adopt` routes in from. Otherwise ask via `star_questionnaire`: *run `star-plan-coach` first (recommended)* / *provide a GitHub URL* / *describe the topic now and search from that*.
