Dispatch read-only `star_subagent` subagents (`subagent_type: Explore`), one per topic — structure & dependencies, config system, data pipeline, train/eval entrypoints, scripts & tools, tests & docs — run in parallel, each returning the structured report in `references/survey_spec.md`. The main agent merges them into the **repo map**: module inventory, dependency direction, ranked suspicious patterns (only those that would motivate a migration item).
